# netlist of sch_feedback.sch, from schnet
part C301 capacitor value 10uF swap 1,2 name feedback.bulk
part J301 bnc value BNC name feedback.out
part R301 resistor value 1k swap 1,2 name feedback.rin
part R302 resistor value 10k swap 1,2 name feedback.rfb
part U301 ti/lmh6609 value LMH6609 pins in+:3,in-:2,out:6,v+:7,v-:4 name feedback.u
net +5V global C301.1 U301.7
net -5V global U301.4
net GND global C301.2 U301.3
net IN global R301.2
net feedback.u.in- R301.1 R302.1 U301.2
net feedback.u.out J301.1 R302.2 U301.6
